### Steps To Reproduce

Given this policy:

```json
{
  "hosts": {
    "n1": "100.64.0.1/32",
    "n2": "100.64.0.2/32",
    "peer-relay": "100.64.0.3/32"
  },
  "grants": [
    {
      "src": ["n1"],
      "dst": ["n2"],
      "ip": ["*"]
    },
    {
